# Files sent to the build of the trainer image (Dockerfile): everything is left out, then only what its stages copy is
# let in again, so that experiments/, .venv, the datasets and local secrets never reach the build
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!vision_training
!scripts
!tests

# Left out of the folders let in: bytecode caches, the exported models of the Triton repository and the staging folders
# of stopped exports
**/__pycache__
vision_training/deployment/triton/served_models
**/.export_staging_*
